IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `iseas-institute`

-- ISEAS - Yusof Ishak Institute Act 1968, ss 4, 6, 10, 13, 14(2)(d)(vii), (h), 14(4), 16, 17 and who decides what -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_iseas-yusof-ishak-institute-act-1968.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 17 -- personal liability`

#ASSERT `the personal liability shield applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the personal liability shield applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the personal liability shield applies` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the personal liability shield applies` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the personal liability shield applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE

